@startuml batch-settlement-flow
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0F19
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #38BDF8
    ActorBorderColor #38BDF8
    LifeLineBorderColor #818CF8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #1E293B
    ParticipantBorderColor #A855F7
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #1E293B
    ParticipantFontColor #F8FAFC
}

autonumber
actor "Settlement Cron / Admin" as Cron #38BDF8
participant "Settlement Service" as Settle #10B981
participant "Payment Service" as Pay #10B981
database "DB Shards (0..3)" as DB #3B82F6
participant "Banking Partner API\n(NPCI / NEFT / RTGS)" as Bank #F59E0B
queue "Kafka Event Bus" as Kafka #EC4899
participant "Reconciliation Engine" as Recon #06B6D4

== 1. Batch Cut-Off & Aggregation ==
Cron -> Settle: Trigger Daily Batch Settlement (BatchSize <= 100,000)
activate Settle

Settle -> DB: Lock & Aggregate Pending Merchant Credits\n(SELECT merchant_id, SUM(amount), COUNT(*) FROM transactions WHERE status='COMPLETED' AND settled=false GROUP BY merchant_id)
activate DB
DB --> Settle: Aggregated Settlement Summary (e.g., 8,500 Merchants, ₹42.5 Cr)
deactivate DB

== 2. Double-Entry Invariant Pre-Validation ==
Settle -> Recon: Validate Pre-Settlement Balance Integrity
activate Recon
Recon --> Settle: Invariant Valid (Σ Debits == Σ Credits)
deactivate Recon

== 3. Core Banking Payout Instruction ==
loop For Each Merchant Batch Chunk (ChunkSize = 500)
    Settle -> Bank: POST /v1/payouts/batch (NEFT/RTGS Transfer Instruction)
    activate Bank
    Bank --> Settle: 202 Accepted (Batch Payout Ref ID: BANK-REF-9921)
    deactivate Bank
    
    Settle -> DB: INSERT INTO merchant_settlements (settlement_id, batch_id, merchant_id, amount, status='PROCESSING')
end

== 4. Asynchronous Payout Webhook & Ledger Finalization ==
Bank -> Settle: Webhook Callback: Payout Batch Success [BANK-REF-9921]
Settle -> Pay: Finalize Merchant Settlement Balances
activate Pay

Pay -> DB: Multi-row UPDATE accounts SET ledger_balance = ledger_balance - :amount WHERE account_id = :merchant_id
activate DB
Pay -> DB: INSERT INTO ledger_entries (SETTLEMENT_PAYOUT, merchant_id, amount, bank_ref)
Pay -> DB: UPDATE merchant_settlements SET status='SETTLED', completed_at=NOW()
DB --> Pay: Batch Update Committed
deactivate DB
Pay --> Settle: Settlement Complete
deactivate Pay

== 5. Audit & Compliance Event Emission ==
Settle -> Kafka: Publish SETTLEMENT_COMPLETED (BatchID, TotalAmount, MerchantCount)
activate Kafka
Kafka -> Recon: Run Post-Settlement Reconciliation
deactivate Kafka
deactivate Settle
@enduml
